WEBVTT

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:34.230
The following tale is a work of pure fiction.

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:45.190
'T-Tis a glazed tea bowl resembling the Araki Kourai!

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:50.750
Did Master Senno learn of my actions...?!

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:01.750
These wonderfully coarse protrusions compliment the lovely loquatesque glaze...

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:06.240
What brilliant mind conceived this beautiful pattern?

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:14.180
Governor Matsunaga chose to end his life as a proper warrior.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:15.510
However...

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:18.510
my karma is greater than his!

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:25.010
<b>Stairway to the Heavens {ts}</b>

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.150
How peculiar...

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.600
This bowl's mere presence escapes the simplicity of this room.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:41.970
He...

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:53.690
he must know.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.130
Forgive me, Osen.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:31.710
Master Senno, I confess to possessing a tea bowl of similar nature.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:41.090
I was taken by greed and failed in my duties towards Milord.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:47.030
I am pleased to hear this.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:52.480
'Twas I who lent the Araki Kourai tea bowl to General Araki.

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:59.340
Several days ago, General Araki wrote to me after reaching Mori's stronghold.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:07.740
"My life was spared by an aesthete from Oda's camp, at the cost of the Araki Kourai."

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:14.020
Then, I suspected 'twas ye who had spared him, Governor Furuta.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:17.060
I've steeled myself for death since that day. {until gozaru}

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:21.970
Do what ye must, and bring me before Milord for my foolishness.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:24.470
I shan't do such a thing.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.310
I enjoy your company far too much to do so.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.250
You hid not your surprise upon identifying this tea bowl.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:39.890
Thus, you had already discerned my trivial ploy in inviting you.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:45.200
Furthermore, your honesty is refreshing. {until shojikisa desu}

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.940
You are repentant of your greed, yet honest with yourself.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:55.420
Only an honest heart may discern the true beauty of tea.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.800
I am but another vessel of greed.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:07.510
May you, perhaps... {until gourai}

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.570
return to me the Araki Kourai?

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:18.360
I've felt naught but regret for lending it to General Araki, {until samearazu}

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.820
and I merely yearn for its return. {until gozaimasu}

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:33.410
Master Senno is truly an enlightened man above all others!

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.180
Master Senno,

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:54.440
I shall return to ye the tea bowl.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.190
In return, I wish to follow as your disciple.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:08.580
I am overjoyed to have invited you this day.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.660
Master's tea was most sublime.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.830
<b>August 1580 {ts}</b>

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.830
<b>Omi Province Azuchi {ts}</b>

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.100
Most impressive, Governor. {until furutasama}

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.890
At long last, Senno Soueki has taken ye as his apprentice.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.390
Behold, Governor.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:37.710
'Tis the new keep of the now complete Azuchi Castle.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.500
T-The castle is now of five stories!

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:53.040
And blackened ramparts now laden with plentiful gold!

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:57.900
I cannot begin to describe the epicness of the keep! {until nanda}

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:02.840
'Tis the beautiful child of Kinkaku Temple
 and Azuchi Castle!

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:08.840
Such is an aesthete to discern the beauty of the castle.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:16.510
Though this keep may serve as a defensive deterrent, it also serves as a residence.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:22.270
The keep's design was influenced by the Zen of Kinkaku Temple, therein the resemblance. {until mitoreru no desu}

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.860
And the advice to paint the ramparts black

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.570
came from Senno Soueki.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:35.570
We Sakai merchants are quite grateful to earning decently by black lacquer.

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.960
The golden figure on the wall is...

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.490
a dragon?

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:07.590
Does Milord's ambition know no ends?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:13.050
Where shall he lead our island nation through this era of war?

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.400
How mysterious...

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:21.500
The pure excitement I felt in Master Senno's tea room {until koufun ga}

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:28.130
is unlike the overwhelming aesthete's curiosity I feel for this castle! {until ga wakaru}

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.320
I shall take my leave.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.490
Long has it been, Mori Ranmaru.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:48.610
Ye conceal not blades, aye?

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:52.240
I remind ye that blades are forbidden within the castle.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.280
This way. {de wa}

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.300
T-The Heavens behold my eyes!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.830
Boa noite.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.290
Good evening, Sasuke.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:29.060
I've longed to see that expression!

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:33.570
Without the eye of an aesthete to appraise the art, the effect is lost on all others.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:40.330
I-I am pleased to see Milord in fine health.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.830
You did well during the assault on Hanakuma Castle. {until yoku yatta}

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:48.580
I heard you assisted Kumquat Mitsuhide in subjugating the Tanba and Tango provinces.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.340
Henceforth, you and Nakagawa Kiyohide are to resume defense of our territories.

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:54.560
Aye.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.630
Select your reward.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:09:59.850
You may have money, or the container.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.350
'Tis a barbarian lacquered container, decorated with silver lacquer!

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:08.350
The vibrant dark-green hue is polished to perfection.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:17.510
Milord knows not of my sparing Araki. {until nogashita koto}

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:21.400
May I grant leeway to greed once more, for the more valuable container?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.240
To do so would betray Milord's expectations.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:28.870
But... {daga}

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:30.630
I want the container!

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:35.880
I yearn for it!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:51.950
I...

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.030
shall accept the money.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.700
'Tis incorrect! {oi sore non}

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.120
F-Forgive my blunder.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:10.750
By your eyes, I see that you conceal from me something.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:15.230
No matter what trivial misdeed you've commit,

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.260
I praise ye for selecting the money.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.900
Listen well, Sasuke.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:25.080
People long for riches they do not possess.

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.270
They do not possess wealth.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:33.020
With wealth may food, items, and ease be procured. {until yutori ni naru}

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:39.150
To earn the loyalty of the people, bequeath upon them their desires.

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:44.650
Though the Mori, Takeda, and Uesugi clans...

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.940
were said to be the top viers for taking the country, {until ten ga torenunoga}

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.850
I accomplished what they could not. {until sore ga dekinu kara da}

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.290
Only those who act out of pride or honor are true warriors.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.860
Now, may ye have others act upon your behalf.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.720
Use your wealth upon anything you deem necessary.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.550
You may also have the container.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.560
There's something I want you to see.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:16.290
This sight is quite extravagant.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:23.530
Milord ordered the people to better the scenery with lanterns?

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.450
For what do ye yearn, Milord?

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:35.380
There are too few who possess forces sufficient enough to oppose Milord's rule.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.680
Have ye not attained all there is to?

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:42.370
Expand your horizons, Sasuke.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.000
Sakai never satisfied my ambition. {until tarin}

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.990
There exist a vast number of rich towns other than Sakai.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.600
Once I have obtained them...

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:56.550
I desire to behold this scenery from the Ming Mainland or Tenjiku.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.460
H-He intends an expedition!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.190
Dragons have always remained the symbol of the Central Kingdom!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:11.640
The dragon below symbolizes Milord's intention to overthrow the Ming Dynasty!

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.580
In the barbarian lands goes a tale...

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:21.630
of a king who built a tower to reach the Heavens, as a display of his power.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:26.400
However, the act was considered sacrilege against their God,

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:29.480
who struck at the tower with bolts of lightning.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.680
The tower was said to be reduced to rubble.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:42.610
And yet, I have not been struck by lightning!

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.360
I shall continue my ascent towards the Heavens!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:11.640
I have learned of a sensation which ascends that of mine with tea brewery!

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:19.760
Milord entrusts the five provinces of Kinki to ye.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:26.850
Now, General Akechi Mitsuhide, ye shall become the most renown of Milord's vassals.

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:31.530
<b>November 1580 {ts}</b>

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:31.530
<b>Harima Province Himeji Castle {ts}</b>

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:55.400
'Tis a porcelain tea bowl from Komogai!

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:02.850
The beautiful glaze of this tea bowl emphasizes the clearness, and pristine color of water. {until migotosa}

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:06.120
Confound it boy, drink it already.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:09.910
Treasure the brew that General Hashiba labored over! {until tatetekudasaru to iu no ni}

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.810
Do forgive the sluggishness of my foolish son.

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:16.830
After my brother passed, I reared my son properly as his true father! {until mairimasuru}

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.790
I'd like to have a word with Sasuke, in private.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:33.100
Do forgive my father, for he has yet to leave the Muromachi period behind.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:37.060
Please, I envy those who still have fathers.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:42.810
I heard you attended General Akechi's banquet.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:47.060
D-Do forgive my foolishness.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:49.510
Please, I harbor no ill-will.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:53.890
I know ye shan't serve him by attending a simple banquet. {until omoute oranwa}

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:58.080
We've known each other since Milord took Gifu Castle in 1567. {until de wa nai ka}

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:03.100
General Akechi accepted Milord's orders to oversee the Kinki region.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.560
'Tis natural for ye to attend his celebratory banquet.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.590
However... {tada}

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:13.300
may I hear the utterances of General Akechi 
from the banquet?

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:21.110
I merely desire the thoughts of the most valued of Milord's vassals, who now oversees the Kinki region. {until shiteokitattena}

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:24.580
Alas, the intent of my presence this day...

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:33.990
Indeed, 'twas one month prior that I attended General Akechi's celebratory banquet at Sakamoto Castle, {until omi no sakamotojou ni}

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:37.330
with my brother, Nakagawa Kiyohide, upon invitation.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:47.600
So, the simian struggles to outwit the Mori clan? {until tekozutteorunoka}

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.340
Simian wit indeed!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:54.280
Master Oda should have entrusted the defeat of the Mori clan to Milord Akechi.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.460
He shan't entrust the invasion of Shikoku to the simian, aye?

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:01.120
There shan't be invasion.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:06.840
Milord has been entrusted to act as mediator between Oda and Chosokabe.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:11.860
As of late, I fail to read the mind of Master Oda.

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:18.140
Though the Imperial Court rescinds his court position as Minister of the Right,

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.880
Master Oda erects a grand castle in the middle of Azuchi!

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.910
What does are his intentions?

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:30.740
Milord's ambitions are that of grandeur.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.630
His ambition may not be contained to this island, alone.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:41.010
D-Does he intend to challenge the Ming and Joseon Dynasties?!

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.730
Preposterous!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.300
Indeed!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.690
He would have us command his war!

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:51.520
Has he any idea of the amount of blood we shed for him?!

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.700
Master Oda may unify the entire island, {until iza shirazu}

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.950
but he shall fail to challenge the technologies of Ming and Joseon!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.780
He must realize this truth! {until kagiri ga aru}

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:04.200
Master Oda dreams of grandeur while we win his wars.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.530
'Tis deluded by grandeur.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:08.750
Insult Milord, aye?

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:14.080
I serve Milord Oda Nobunaga!

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:17.260
To insult Milord is to insult me!

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.010
Sasuke, apologize!

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:23.640
'Tis General Akechi's banquet!

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:32.070
Hidemitsu, apologize to Governor Furuta.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.950
M-Milord...!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.770
Slay me, have ye qualms.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:56.210
I shan't give struggle, nor shall I despise.

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:03.690
Well?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.870
Speak ill not of Milord.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:28.100
There is none as devoted to his ambition and others as he.

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:33.880
Once, a vassal was lax in his duties during Milord's absence.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:38.400
After Milord learned of this, he ordered the vassal's clan executed.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:43.140
Milord reasons that the laxness of his vassals endangers the realm.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:48.890
Only a seasoned lord of a grand army may order such a cruel punishment.

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:56.150
Though Milord's actions seem awry, he does so earnestly.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:02.010
Should your stipend be well-deserved, ye shall be rewarded.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.060
As I was without a lord to serve once, {until kono mitsuhide wo}

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:07.410
I remind ye to be grateful of your awarded positions.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:13.840
We shall keep Milord's loyalty to heart.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:30.560
Akechi Mitsuhide certainly earned the title of "Wise General" for such qualities.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.230
Leave your displeasure unspoken.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:38.110
I shall prepare tea for refreshment. {from kibun wo kae until yoi itasu}

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:44.460
At last! {kita}

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.790
I shall behold the Hakkaku teakettle!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:55.850
I shall behold the treasured Hakkaku teakettle bestowed by Milord! {until kono me de}

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.640
However...

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:08.410
General Akechi brought forth a mere Round teakettle.

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:13.690
Did he say anything whilst brewing?

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:14.770
Nay.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:19.220
The banquet had ended without further incidence after drinking tea.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:20.320
Indeed...

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:27.510
'Tis true, General Akechi ordered his men to leave their displeasures unspoken?

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:28.620
Aye.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:40.140
Do forgive me for asking this of you, {until warui ga}

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:44.500
but I still grasp naught of the general's thoughts.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.990
I've only reaffirmed that his loyalty to Milord is equal to my own. {until chuugimono}

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:13.120
Milord bestowed upon me a sensation of awe from the keep of Azuchi Castle.

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:21.820
And the porcelain tea bowl from Komogai.

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:25.620
Though an informal tea gathering...

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:31.130
General Hashiba brewed tea with a gift from Milord, and General Akechi had not.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:41.830
Were the general to esteem Milord, he would have prepared tea with Milord's gift. {until motenasubeki de wa}

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:46.550
General Akechi is alike myself and possesses many tea treasures.

00:22:47.280 --> 00:22:49.530
He shan't be ignorant of their use.

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:53.970
Yet, why?

00:24:36.470 --> 00:24:38.140
<b>You look hilarious in those garments {ts}</b>

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:45.150
<b>Curses{ts*}</b>

00:24:49.440 --> 00:24:51.110
<b>Good day to ye, my dear {ts*}</b>

00:24:51.110 --> 00:24:53.560
Next time, "Kind of Black."

00:24:54.210 --> 00:24:58.130
Does the fork joining the warrior and aesthete truly exist?

00:24:56.740 --> 00:24:59.900
<b>Kind of Black {ts}</b>
